[01:00.150]My dear, please tell me
[01:05.730]The omens of burning or extinguishing
[01:16.020]I lie upon your body
[01:22.980]Like a ballad never born
[01:37.290]But Dawn she comes with her sickle
[01:44.550]Shining down into our cellar
[01:51.120]Harvesting line upon line of
[01:58.110]Creeds that reflect eternal
[02:36.990]Fate brought us into an embrace
[02:44.100]Yet love made us let go
[02:50.130]Is it that you hear the praise of the birds
[02:56.970]When their branches are broken and destroyed in flame?
[03:03.600]Is it that you drop all guards
[03:10.290]When told the end of a tale?
[03:20.580]Do not weep before that grave
[03:25.980]When we recognize each other
[03:33.150]Our bright colors and our withering
[03:41.220]Will brighten the land
[03:46.107]
